  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: "Evening, doctor. I'm freezing, and my hand hurts from a knock.\nI caught it on the rail coming down the stairs.\nPerhaps I should have carried a lamp in my other hand."
